==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*1 [[Kaijin Doge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 1.67~5 seconds<sup>50f~150f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 1.67~5 seconds<sup>50f~150f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Archbaron Face]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 1.67~5 seconds<sup>50f~150f</sup>.
**8 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 5~15 seconds<sup>150f~450f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
**8 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Capy|Capies]] spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Stall the opening wave of Gabriels to allow your units to go off cooldown, then hit them with everything you have in the form of [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Rangers]], [[Barista Cat (Special Cat)|Silver Nyanko Rangers]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cats]], [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cats]], and whatever other attackers you might want to include like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] or [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]]. With a good line of meatshields, the enemies cannot break through at all, and you'll soon exhaust all the peons. At that point, either take care of Angelic Sleipnir or Archbaron Face Face, and claim your easy victory.

